WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:02.400
«Un immigré». «Un étranger».

2
00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:03.670
«Un descendant d'immigrés».

3
00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:07.000
Three labels. Do they
mean the same people?

4
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:11.670
For 2025, France's statistics
office gives a provisional figure:

5
00:00:11.670 --> 00:00:16.200
8 million immigrants, 11.6
per cent of the population.

6
00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:19.570
Some worked in car factories
at Boulogne-Billancourt.

7
00:00:19.570 --> 00:00:22.120
Many lived in shanty towns at Nanterre:

8
00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:24.810
«les bidonvilles». So who came to France,

9
00:00:24.810 --> 00:00:27.430
when, and what did they bring with them?

10
00:00:27.430 --> 00:00:30.390
In this mission, you'll unroll Mission D1,

11
00:00:30.390 --> 00:00:33.700
a timeline of waves,
with arrows to France.

12
00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:36.360
Then you'll meet people
behind the contributions,

13
00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:39.380
in science, song, sport and food,

14
00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:41.690
and argue: «une chance pour la France»?

15
00:00:41.690 --> 00:00:43.990
Your mission: find out who came,

16
00:00:43.990 --> 00:00:46.210
when, and what they brought to France.
